{
  "about": "The role view a host sends a phone that asked for it (GET /m1/sessions/{id}?roles=1, capability \"roles\"; docs/mobile-remote.md \"역할 보기\"): for the saved runs of a case, in Korean, what the Mighty payload carries. Both hosts produce it from the runs (the Mac MobileFlowTests, Windows Core MobileFlowVerification) and the phone renders it (mobile/src/__tests__/flow-roles.test.ts). `expect` lists of each run its id and status, and of each block id, kind, title, status, background and the role view's role, card and delegate; of each run its returning and advisor; and the payload's fanOut and log. A key that is absent here is absent on the wire. `outputTails` are a background command's last output lines by block id, which a host holds in memory. Times on the wire are milliseconds since 1970. A request also carries its progress (progress: the panel pinned over the phone's Mighty view: its heading, state, first line and its plan's rows), and a compact row launched in one of its steps names that step (card.step).",
